{"lines": [{"text": "For decades, this tiny painting hung above a hot plate in an old woman's kitchen. She thought it was worthless.", "start": 0.3, "end": 6.924, "spec": {"shot": "h_kitchen", "ui": "hook"}, "afx": null, "words": [["For", 0.132, 0.204], ["decades", 0.216, 0.986], ["this", 1.178, 1.358], ["tiny", 1.37, 1.923], ["painting", 1.935, 2.308], ["hung", 2.32, 2.632], ["above", 2.632, 2.824], ["a", 2.825, 2.861], ["hot", 2.861, 3.197], ["plate", 3.197, 3.582], ["in", 3.678, 3.762], ["an", 3.762, 3.87], ["old", 3.882, 4.087], ["woman's", 4.087, 4.327], ["kitchen", 4.339, 4.724], ["She", 5.096, 5.228], ["thought", 5.24, 5.421], ["it", 5.421, 5.457], ["was", 5.457, 5.565], ["worthless", 5.565, 6.262]]}, {"text": "Then someone took a closer look. A few months later, it sold for twenty-four million euros.", "start": 7.344, "end": 12.552, "spec": {"shot": "h_sold", "ui": "sold"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.084, 0.156], ["someone", 0.156, 0.325], ["took", 0.337, 0.457], ["a", 0.457, 0.505], ["closer", 0.505, 0.913], ["look", 0.925, 1.262], ["A", 1.635, 1.683], ["few", 1.683, 1.851], ["months", 1.851, 2.091], ["later", 2.103, 2.428], ["it", 2.8, 2.873], ["sold", 2.873, 3.269], ["for", 3.269, 3.377], ["twenty-four", 3.377, 3.93], ["million", 3.942, 4.291], ["euros", 4.291, 4.868]]}, {"text": "That's number one on this list. But first, five other people who found a fortune completely by accident.", "start": 12.972, "end": 19.476, "spec": {"shot": "list", "ui": "list"}, "afx": null, "words": [["That's", 0.108, 0.264], ["number", 0.264, 0.481], ["one", 0.481, 0.685], ["on", 0.697, 0.793], ["this", 0.793, 0.962], ["list", 0.962, 1.418], ["But", 1.803, 1.911], ["first", 1.911, 2.44], ["five", 2.704, 3.029], ["other", 3.041, 3.245], ["people", 3.245, 3.594], ["who", 3.594, 3.798], ["found", 3.798, 4.087], ["a", 4.087, 4.123], ["fortune", 4.123, 4.736], ["completely", 4.796, 5.385], ["by", 5.385, 5.577], ["accident", 5.589, 6.154]]}, {"text": "A ring from a car boot sale. A four-dollar painting. A rusty can. A lost hammer. And a leaky attic.", "start": 19.896, "end": 26.592, "spec": {"shot": "list2", "ui": "teaser"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.084, 0.132], ["ring", 0.144, 0.409], ["from", 0.409, 0.529], ["a", 0.541, 0.589], ["car", 0.601, 0.889], ["boot", 0.901, 1.082], ["sale", 1.082, 1.442], ["A", 1.827, 1.875], ["four-dollar", 1.875, 2.392], ["painting", 2.392, 2.825], ["A", 3.209, 3.245], ["rusty", 3.245, 3.582], ["can", 3.582, 3.93], ["A", 4.315, 4.351], ["lost", 4.351, 4.699], ["hammer", 4.699, 5.06], ["And", 5.433, 5.493], ["a", 5.493, 5.565], ["leaky", 5.565, 5.998], ["attic", 5.998, 6.346]]}, {"text": "Number six. West London, the late 1980s.", "start": 27.012, "end": 30.684, "spec": {"shot": "r_boot", "cut": true, "mood": "calm", "ui": "n6"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.276], ["six", 0.288, 0.793], ["West", 1.178, 1.394], ["London", 1.394, 1.779], ["the", 1.971, 2.067], ["late", 2.079, 2.332], ["1980s", 2.344, 3.329]]}, {"text": "A woman is browsing a car boot sale. That's like a flea market, out of the trunks of cars.", "start": 31.104, "end": 36.648, "spec": {"shot": "r_browse", "ui": "boot"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.096, 0.156], ["woman", 0.168, 0.433], ["is", 0.445, 0.553], ["browsing", 0.565, 1.142], ["a", 1.154, 1.202], ["car", 1.214, 1.514], ["boot", 1.514, 1.683], ["sale", 1.683, 2.091], ["That's", 2.488, 2.584], ["like", 2.584, 2.68], ["a", 2.68, 2.728], ["flea", 2.74, 3.077], ["market", 3.077, 3.57], ["out", 4.014, 4.099], ["of", 4.111, 4.159], ["the", 4.159, 4.207], ["trunks", 4.219, 4.567], ["of", 4.567, 4.627], ["cars", 4.627, 5.204]]}, {"text": "In a box of cheap costume jewelry, she spots a big, sparkly ring. The seller wants twelve pounds. She haggles him down to ten.", "start": 37.068, "end": 45.396, "spec": {"shot": "r_haggle", "ui": "gbp10"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.084, 0.144], ["a", 0.144, 0.192], ["box", 0.204, 0.553], ["of", 0.553, 0.661], ["cheap", 0.673, 0.949], ["costume", 0.95, 1.406], ["jewelry", 1.418, 1.839], ["she", 2.067, 2.224], ["spots", 2.224, 2.608], ["a", 2.68, 2.752], ["big", 2.752, 3.185], ["sparkly", 3.474, 4.002], ["ring", 4.014, 4.315], ["The", 4.712, 4.76], ["seller", 4.772, 5.06], ["wants", 5.06, 5.312], ["twelve", 5.324, 5.637], ["pounds", 5.637, 6.214], ["She", 6.623, 6.767], ["haggles", 6.767, 7.175], ["him", 7.176, 7.26], ["down", 7.272, 7.536], ["to", 7.536, 7.584], ["ten", 7.596, 7.993]]}, {"text": "She thinks it's glass. So she just wears it. For about thirty years.", "start": 45.816, "end": 50.064, "spec": {"shot": "r_wear", "ui": "yrs30"}, "afx": null, "words": [["She", 0.096, 0.216], ["thinks", 0.216, 0.409], ["it's", 0.409, 0.493], ["glass", 0.505, 1.094], ["So", 1.478, 1.55], ["she", 1.55, 1.671], ["just", 1.671, 1.839], ["wears", 1.839, 2.127], ["it", 2.127, 2.272], ["For", 2.68, 2.74], ["about", 2.74, 2.993], ["thirty", 3.005, 3.341], ["years", 3.341, 3.894]]}, {"text": "Then, in 2017, she finally asks a jeweler to take a look.", "start": 50.484, "end": 55.116, "spec": {"shot": "r_jeweler", "ui": "jeweler"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.409], ["in 2017", 0.601, 1.707], ["she", 2.103, 2.272], ["finally", 2.272, 2.68], ["asks", 2.68, 3.041], ["a", 3.053, 3.113], ["jeweler", 3.113, 3.606], ["to", 3.606, 3.678], ["take", 3.678, 3.906], ["a", 3.906, 3.954], ["look", 3.954, 4.279]]}, {"text": "It's not glass. It's a real diamond, over twenty-six carats, from the eighteen-hundreds.", "start": 55.536, "end": 61.104, "spec": {"shot": "r_real", "ui": "ct26"}, "afx": null, "words": [["It's", 0.096, 0.192], ["not", 0.192, 0.385], ["glass", 0.385, 0.95], ["It's", 1.334, 1.43], ["a", 1.43, 1.49], ["real", 1.49, 1.839], ["diamond", 1.839, 2.344], ["over", 2.608, 2.8], ["twenty-six", 2.8, 3.353], ["carats", 3.365, 3.966], ["from", 4.123, 4.243], ["the", 4.243, 4.291], ["eighteen-hundreds", 4.291, 5.228]]}, {"text": "Sotheby's expected up to three hundred and fifty thousand pounds.", "start": 61.524, "end": 65.364, "spec": {"shot": "r_estimate", "ui": "est"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Sotheby's", 0.096, 0.481], ["expected", 0.481, 0.925], ["up", 0.938, 1.058], ["to", 1.058, 1.202], ["three", 1.322, 1.707], ["hundred", 1.719, 1.923], ["and", 1.923, 2.007], ["fifty", 2.091, 2.452], ["thousand", 2.452, 2.873], ["pounds", 2.873, 3.474]]}, {"text": "It sold for six hundred and fifty-six thousand pounds. Not bad for a tenner.", "start": 65.784, "end": 70.656, "spec": {"shot": "r_sold", "ui": "gbp656k"}, "afx": null, "words": [["It", 0.084, 0.156], ["sold", 0.168, 0.457], ["for", 0.469, 0.625], ["six", 0.637, 0.95], ["hundred", 0.962, 1.142], ["and", 1.142, 1.202], ["fifty-six", 1.202, 2.019], ["thousand", 2.031, 2.428], ["pounds", 2.428, 3.017], ["Not", 3.413, 3.642], ["bad", 3.654, 3.93], ["for", 3.942, 4.087], ["a", 4.087, 4.123], ["tenner", 4.135, 4.507]]}, {"text": "Number five. Adamstown, Pennsylvania, 1989.", "start": 71.076, "end": 75.396, "spec": {"shot": "d_market", "cut": true, "mood": "calm", "ui": "n5"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.072, 0.288], ["five", 0.288, 0.697], ["Adamstown, Pennsylvania", 1.082, 2.764], ["1989", 3.005, 3.954]]}, {"text": "A man at a flea market buys an old painting for four dollars. He doesn't care about the picture. He just wants the frame.", "start": 75.816, "end": 82.968, "spec": {"shot": "d_buy", "ui": "usd4"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.072, 0.12], ["man", 0.12, 0.457], ["at", 0.517, 0.589], ["a", 0.601, 0.637], ["flea", 0.637, 0.986], ["market", 0.986, 1.418], ["buys", 1.418, 1.779], ["an", 1.791, 1.923], ["old", 2.079, 2.404], ["painting", 2.416, 2.885], ["for", 2.897, 3.077], ["four", 3.077, 3.377], ["dollars", 3.377, 3.954], ["He", 4.339, 4.387], ["doesn't", 4.387, 4.615], ["care", 4.615, 4.868], ["about", 4.868, 5.072], ["the", 5.072, 5.144], ["picture", 5.144, 5.625], ["He", 6.022, 6.058], ["just", 6.058, 6.202], ["wants", 6.202, 6.358], ["the", 6.358, 6.43], ["frame", 6.43, 6.791]]}, {"text": "At home, he takes it apart. The old frame falls to pieces.", "start": 83.388, "end": 87.9, "spec": {"shot": "d_break", "ui": "break"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.096, 0.168], ["home", 0.18, 0.565], ["he", 0.95, 1.022], ["takes", 1.022, 1.262], ["it", 1.262, 1.31], ["apart", 1.31, 1.695], ["The", 2.079, 2.187], ["old", 2.2, 2.44], ["frame", 2.44, 2.969], ["falls", 3.113, 3.462], ["to", 3.462, 3.558], ["pieces", 3.558, 4.159]]}, {"text": "And hidden behind the painting, he finds a folded piece of paper.", "start": 88.32, "end": 92.232, "spec": {"shot": "d_paper", "ui": "paper"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.18], ["hidden", 0.18, 0.457], ["behind", 0.457, 0.757], ["the", 0.757, 0.805], ["painting", 0.805, 1.25], ["he", 1.611, 1.683], ["finds", 1.683, 1.959], ["a", 1.959, 1.995], ["folded", 2.007, 2.56], ["piece", 2.56, 2.885], ["of", 2.885, 2.969], ["paper", 2.981, 3.546]]}, {"text": "It's a copy of the Declaration of Independence. Not a souvenir. One of the very first printings, from July 1776.", "start": 92.652, "end": 101.484, "spec": {"shot": "d_decl", "ui": "y1776"}, "afx": null, "words": [["It's", 0.096, 0.18], ["a", 0.18, 0.24], ["copy", 0.252, 0.793], ["of", 0.805, 0.889], ["the", 0.901, 0.974], ["Declaration", 0.986, 1.731], ["of", 1.875, 1.983], ["Independence", 1.983, 2.704], ["Not", 3.077, 3.209], ["a", 3.209, 3.245], ["souvenir", 3.245, 3.822], ["One", 4.207, 4.291], ["of", 4.291, 4.327], ["the", 4.339, 4.411], ["very", 4.411, 4.784], ["first", 4.796, 5.204], ["printings", 5.216, 5.913], ["from", 6.094, 6.238], ["July 1776", 6.25, 8.462]]}, {"text": "Only a couple of dozen copies of that printing were known to still exist.", "start": 101.904, "end": 106.104, "spec": {"shot": "d_rare", "ui": "rare"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Only", 0.096, 0.288], ["a", 0.288, 0.337], ["couple", 0.337, 0.685], ["of", 0.697, 0.901], ["dozen", 1.034, 1.37], ["copies", 1.37, 1.767], ["of", 1.767, 1.827], ["that", 1.827, 1.983], ["printing", 1.983, 2.38], ["were", 2.56, 2.668], ["known", 2.668, 2.981], ["to", 2.981, 3.041], ["still", 3.053, 3.293], ["exist", 3.293, 3.834]]}, {"text": "In 1991, it sold at auction for two point four million dollars.", "start": 106.524, "end": 110.94, "spec": {"shot": "d_sold", "ui": "usd242"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In 1991", 0.096, 1.082], ["it", 1.49, 1.562], ["sold", 1.562, 1.815], ["at", 1.815, 1.887], ["auction", 1.887, 2.26], ["for", 2.272, 2.416], ["two", 2.428, 2.644], ["point", 2.656, 2.921], ["four", 2.921, 3.185], ["million", 3.185, 3.474], ["dollars", 3.474, 4.05]]}, {"text": "And nine years later, it sold again. This time for more than eight million.", "start": 111.36, "end": 115.824, "spec": {"shot": "d_resold", "ui": "usd8m"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.18], ["nine", 0.192, 0.445], ["years", 0.445, 0.661], ["later", 0.673, 1.046], ["it", 1.262, 1.322], ["sold", 1.322, 1.599], ["again", 1.599, 1.923], ["This", 2.308, 2.44], ["time", 2.44, 2.656], ["for", 2.656, 2.776], ["more", 2.788, 3.113], ["than", 3.113, 3.269], ["eight", 3.377, 3.618], ["million", 3.618, 4.111]]}, {"text": "Number four. Northern California, 2013.", "start": 116.244, "end": 120.012, "spec": {"shot": "s_hill", "cut": true, "mood": "bright", "ui": "n4"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.096, 0.3], ["four", 0.3, 0.661], ["Northern", 1.058, 1.334], ["California", 1.334, 1.983], ["2013", 2.26, 3.426]]}, {"text": "A couple is walking their dog on their own land.", "start": 120.432, "end": 123.168, "spec": {"shot": "s_walk", "ui": "walk"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.096, 0.156], ["couple", 0.156, 0.529], ["is", 0.541, 0.637], ["walking", 0.637, 1.022], ["their", 1.034, 1.142], ["dog", 1.142, 1.538], ["on", 1.55, 1.635], ["their", 1.635, 1.767], ["own", 1.779, 1.971], ["land", 1.983, 2.38]]}, {"text": "Then, they notice an old rusty can, sticking out of the ground.", "start": 123.588, "end": 127.908, "spec": {"shot": "s_can", "ui": "can"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Then", 0.096, 0.3], ["they", 0.517, 0.601], ["notice", 0.601, 0.889], ["an", 0.889, 0.998], ["old", 1.106, 1.49], ["rusty", 1.502, 2.115], ["can", 2.404, 2.776], ["sticking", 2.993, 3.365], ["out", 3.365, 3.425], ["of", 3.425, 3.462], ["the", 3.462, 3.522], ["ground", 3.522, 3.966]]}, {"text": "They dig it out. Inside: gold coins.", "start": 128.328, "end": 131.328, "spec": {"shot": "s_open", "ui": "gold"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.108, 0.18], ["dig", 0.192, 0.361], ["it", 0.373, 0.421], ["out", 0.421, 0.709], ["Inside", 1.106, 1.671], ["gold", 1.827, 2.067], ["coins", 2.067, 2.644]]}, {"text": "They keep digging. In the end, they find eight cans, with fourteen hundred and twenty-seven gold coins.", "start": 131.748, "end": 138.156, "spec": {"shot": "s_cans", "ui": "coins1427"}, "afx": null, "words": [["They", 0.096, 0.18], ["keep", 0.18, 0.421], ["digging", 0.421, 0.817], ["In", 1.19, 1.262], ["the", 1.262, 1.31], ["end", 1.322, 1.767], ["they", 2.007, 2.127], ["find", 2.127, 2.56], ["eight", 2.728, 2.945], ["cans", 2.945, 3.522], ["with", 3.702, 3.834], ["fourteen", 3.834, 4.327], ["hundred", 4.327, 4.543], ["and", 4.543, 4.591], ["twenty-seven", 4.591, 5.12], ["gold", 5.12, 5.433], ["coins", 5.445, 6.058]]}, {"text": "The coins are from 1847 to 1894, most of them minted in San Francisco. Their face value: about twenty-eight thousand dollars.", "start": 138.576, "end": 147.768, "spec": {"shot": "s_dates", "ui": "face"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.168], ["coins", 0.168, 0.469], ["are", 0.469, 0.565], ["from 1847 to 1894", 0.577, 3.149], ["most", 3.594, 3.846], ["of", 3.846, 3.894], ["them", 3.894, 4.026], ["minted", 4.026, 4.435], ["in", 4.447, 4.615], ["San", 4.627, 4.88], ["Francisco", 4.892, 5.661], ["Their", 6.058, 6.178], ["face", 6.178, 6.49], ["value", 6.502, 6.947], ["about", 7.248, 7.512], ["twenty-eight", 7.512, 7.921], ["thousand", 7.921, 8.293], ["dollars", 8.293, 8.822]]}, {"text": "But to collectors, they're worth around ten million.", "start": 148.188, "end": 151.356, "spec": {"shot": "s_value", "ui": "usd10m"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.096, 0.156], ["to", 0.156, 0.24], ["collectors", 0.24, 0.986], ["they're", 1.154, 1.334], ["worth", 1.334, 1.623], ["around", 1.623, 2.091], ["ten", 2.103, 2.392], ["million", 2.404, 2.824]]}, {"text": "Some people guessed they were stolen from the San Francisco Mint in 1901. But the Mint said it found no link.", "start": 151.776, "end": 157.776, "spec": {"shot": "s_mint", "ui": "mint"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Some", 0.096, 0.264], ["people", 0.264, 0.553], ["guessed", 0.553, 0.938], ["they", 0.95, 1.034], ["were", 1.034, 1.13], ["stolen", 1.13, 1.562], ["from", 1.575, 1.683], ["the", 1.683, 1.743], ["San", 1.743, 2.019], ["Francisco", 2.031, 2.548], ["Mint", 2.548, 2.885], ["in 1901", 3.041, 3.858], ["But", 4.243, 4.315], ["the", 4.315, 4.375], ["Mint", 4.375, 4.531], ["said", 4.531, 4.7], ["it", 4.699, 4.76], ["found", 4.772, 5.06], ["no", 5.06, 5.228], ["link", 5.228, 5.649]]}, {"text": "At first, the couple hid them in an old cooler, under a pile of firewood.", "start": 158.196, "end": 162.588, "spec": {"shot": "s_cooler", "ui": "cooler"}, "afx": null, "words": [["At", 0.096, 0.18], ["first", 0.192, 0.697], ["the", 0.781, 0.865], ["couple", 0.877, 1.166], ["hid", 1.166, 1.346], ["them", 1.346, 1.514], ["in", 1.526, 1.599], ["an", 1.599, 1.707], ["old", 1.719, 2.007], ["cooler", 2.019, 2.584], ["under", 2.812, 3.005], ["a", 3.005, 3.053], ["pile", 3.065, 3.462], ["of", 3.462, 3.51], ["firewood", 3.51, 4.038]]}, {"text": "And who buried them? To this day, nobody knows.", "start": 163.008, "end": 165.888, "spec": {"shot": "s_mystery", "ui": "mystery"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.144], ["who", 0.156, 0.288], ["buried", 0.288, 0.637], ["them", 0.637, 0.841], ["To", 1.238, 1.298], ["this", 1.298, 1.466], ["day", 1.466, 1.719], ["nobody", 1.731, 2.019], ["knows", 2.019, 2.536]]}, {"text": "Number three. Suffolk, England, November 1992.", "start": 166.308, "end": 170.892, "spec": {"shot": "x_field", "cut": true, "mood": "calm", "ui": "n3"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.084, 0.288], ["three", 0.3, 0.709], ["Suffolk", 1.094, 1.659], ["England", 1.887, 2.296], ["November 1992", 2.56, 4.231]]}, {"text": "A farmer loses his hammer somewhere in a field. So he asks a friend for help.", "start": 171.312, "end": 175.8, "spec": {"shot": "x_hammer", "ui": "hammer"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.096, 0.144], ["farmer", 0.144, 0.541], ["loses", 0.553, 0.95], ["his", 0.962, 1.082], ["hammer", 1.082, 1.418], ["somewhere", 1.418, 1.815], ["in", 1.827, 1.911], ["a", 1.923, 1.959], ["field", 1.959, 2.428], ["So", 2.825, 2.933], ["he", 2.933, 3.089], ["asks", 3.089, 3.329], ["a", 3.329, 3.377], ["friend", 3.377, 3.714], ["for", 3.726, 3.858], ["help", 3.87, 4.159]]}, {"text": "His friend has a metal detector. He got it as a retirement present.", "start": 176.22, "end": 180.132, "spec": {"shot": "x_detector", "ui": "detector"}, "afx": null, "words": [["His", 0.096, 0.204], ["friend", 0.216, 0.673], ["has", 0.685, 0.841], ["a", 0.841, 0.877], ["metal", 0.877, 1.142], ["detector", 1.154, 1.755], ["He", 2.139, 2.199], ["got", 2.2, 2.416], ["it", 2.416, 2.488], ["as", 2.5, 2.62], ["a", 2.62, 2.656], ["retirement", 2.656, 3.149], ["present", 3.149, 3.558]]}, {"text": "The detector beeps. But it's not the hammer. It's coins. Silver coins. Gold coins. Spoons. Jewelry.", "start": 180.552, "end": 188.712, "spec": {"shot": "x_beep", "ui": "beep"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.132], ["detector", 0.144, 0.589], ["beeps", 0.589, 1.106], ["But", 1.49, 1.526], ["it's", 1.538, 1.635], ["not", 1.635, 1.839], ["the", 1.839, 1.899], ["hammer", 1.911, 2.38], ["It's", 2.764, 2.861], ["coins", 2.873, 3.474], ["Silver", 3.87, 4.171], ["coins", 4.171, 4.712], ["Gold", 5.108, 5.312], ["coins", 5.312, 5.925], ["Spoons", 6.298, 6.899], ["Jewelry", 7.296, 7.812]]}, {"text": "And here's the smart part. He stops digging, and calls the police.", "start": 189.132, "end": 193.02, "spec": {"shot": "x_stop", "ui": "police"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.084, 0.144], ["here's", 0.144, 0.397], ["the", 0.397, 0.469], ["smart", 0.469, 0.745], ["part", 0.745, 1.034], ["He", 1.442, 1.514], ["stops", 1.514, 1.827], ["digging", 1.827, 2.224], ["and", 2.476, 2.56], ["calls", 2.56, 2.812], ["the", 2.812, 2.897], ["police", 2.897, 3.534]]}, {"text": "The next day, archaeologists dig out the whole find.", "start": 193.44, "end": 196.608, "spec": {"shot": "x_dig", "ui": "dig"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.144], ["next", 0.144, 0.361], ["day", 0.361, 0.673], ["archaeologists", 0.841, 1.538], ["dig", 1.538, 1.791], ["out", 1.803, 2.031], ["the", 2.043, 2.115], ["whole", 2.115, 2.356], ["find", 2.356, 2.825]]}, {"text": "Almost fifteen thousand Roman coins, plus about two hundred silver and gold objects. Buried around sixteen hundred years ago.", "start": 197.028, "end": 204.684, "spec": {"shot": "x_count", "ui": "coins15k"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Almost", 0.108, 0.421], ["fifteen", 0.421, 0.901], ["thousand", 0.901, 1.31], ["Roman", 1.322, 1.538], ["coins", 1.55, 2.067], ["plus", 2.296, 2.536], ["about", 2.536, 2.788], ["two", 2.8, 2.993], ["hundred", 2.993, 3.245], ["silver", 3.245, 3.762], ["and", 3.774, 3.858], ["gold", 3.87, 4.147], ["objects", 4.159, 4.82], ["Buried", 5.216, 5.481], ["around", 5.493, 5.817], ["sixteen", 5.829, 6.406], ["hundred", 6.418, 6.683], ["years", 6.683, 6.947], ["ago", 6.947, 7.308]]}, {"text": "It's now in the British Museum. The reward: one point seven five million pounds, shared with the farmer.", "start": 205.104, "end": 211.68, "spec": {"shot": "x_reward", "ui": "gbp175m"}, "afx": null, "words": [["It's", 0.096, 0.204], ["now", 0.204, 0.517], ["in", 0.529, 0.565], ["the", 0.565, 0.637], ["British", 0.637, 0.938], ["Museum", 0.938, 1.406], ["The", 1.803, 1.887], ["reward", 1.887, 2.368], ["one", 2.8, 2.969], ["point", 2.969, 3.233], ["seven", 3.245, 3.57], ["five", 3.57, 3.966], ["million", 3.978, 4.423], ["pounds", 4.435, 5.024], ["shared", 5.24, 5.553], ["with", 5.553, 5.625], ["the", 5.625, 5.685], ["farmer", 5.697, 6.226]]}, {"text": "Oh, and the hammer? They found that too. It's in the British Museum as well.", "start": 212.1, "end": 216.324, "spec": {"shot": "x_hammer2", "mood": "bright", "ui": "hammer2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Oh", 0.096, 0.325], ["and", 0.349, 0.433], ["the", 0.433, 0.481], ["hammer", 0.481, 0.841], ["They", 1.226, 1.298], ["found", 1.298, 1.514], ["that", 1.526, 1.671], ["too", 1.671, 1.983], ["It's", 2.368, 2.464], ["in", 2.464, 2.536], ["the", 2.536, 2.632], ["British", 2.632, 2.921], ["Museum", 2.921, 3.365], ["as", 3.377, 3.486], ["well", 3.486, 3.882]]}, {"text": "Number two. Toulouse, France, 2014.", "start": 216.744, "end": 220.704, "spec": {"shot": "c_house", "cut": true, "mood": "tense", "ui": "n2"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Number", 0.072, 0.276], ["two", 0.276, 0.565], ["Toulouse", 0.962, 1.55], ["France", 1.755, 2.416], ["2014", 2.584, 3.618]]}, {"text": "A family calls a local auctioneer to look at something in their attic. It's dark, cluttered, and the roof is leaking.", "start": 221.124, "end": 228.252, "spec": {"shot": "c_attic", "ui": "attic"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.084, 0.132], ["family", 0.132, 0.493], ["calls", 0.493, 0.733], ["a", 0.733, 0.781], ["local", 0.793, 1.166], ["auctioneer", 1.166, 1.767], ["to", 1.899, 1.995], ["look", 1.995, 2.224], ["at", 2.224, 2.296], ["something", 2.296, 2.8], ["in", 2.812, 2.897], ["their", 2.897, 3.029], ["attic", 3.029, 3.437], ["It's", 3.834, 3.966], ["dark", 3.966, 4.387], ["cluttered", 4.591, 5.096], ["and", 5.349, 5.409], ["the", 5.409, 5.481], ["roof", 5.481, 5.949], ["is", 6.202, 6.346], ["leaking", 6.346, 6.779]]}, {"text": "Leaning against a wall is a huge, old painting. A woman is cutting off a man's head.", "start": 228.672, "end": 234.072, "spec": {"shot": "c_canvas", "ui": "canvas"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Leaning", 0.084, 0.337], ["against", 0.349, 0.625], ["a", 0.625, 0.673], ["wall", 0.673, 1.034], ["is", 1.046, 1.178], ["a", 1.178, 1.214], ["huge", 1.214, 2.019], ["old", 2.26, 2.512], ["painting", 2.512, 2.981], ["A", 3.365, 3.425], ["woman", 3.425, 3.678], ["is", 3.678, 3.762], ["cutting", 3.774, 4.062], ["off", 4.062, 4.339], ["a", 4.351, 4.387], ["man's", 4.399, 4.76], ["head", 4.772, 5.06]]}, {"text": "An expert from Paris studies it, and makes a bold claim. He thinks it was painted by Caravaggio, one of the most famous painters of all time.", "start": 234.492, "end": 242.652, "spec": {"shot": "c_expert", "ui": "expert"}, "afx": null, "words": [["An", 0.084, 0.192], ["expert", 0.192, 0.541], ["from", 0.541, 0.721], ["Paris", 0.733, 1.202], ["studies", 1.214, 1.538], ["it", 1.538, 1.683], ["and", 2.079, 2.151], ["makes", 2.151, 2.356], ["a", 2.428, 2.488], ["bold", 2.5, 2.861], ["claim", 2.861, 3.245], ["He", 3.63, 3.702], ["thinks", 3.702, 3.942], ["it", 3.942, 3.99], ["was", 4.002, 4.135], ["painted", 4.135, 4.519], ["by", 4.531, 4.688], ["Caravaggio", 4.699, 5.529], ["one", 5.986, 6.07], ["of", 6.07, 6.106], ["the", 6.106, 6.154], ["most", 6.154, 6.37], ["famous", 6.382, 6.803], ["painters", 6.803, 7.188], ["of", 7.188, 7.26], ["all", 7.26, 7.428], ["time", 7.428, 7.8]]}, {"text": "France bans the painting from leaving the country for more than two years, while experts examine it. Estimates go up to one hundred and fifty million euros.", "start": 243.072, "end": 252.672, "spec": {"shot": "c_estimate", "ui": "eur150m"}, "afx": null, "words": [["France", 0.12, 0.505], ["bans", 0.505, 1.046], ["the", 1.106, 1.226], ["painting", 1.226, 1.815], ["from", 1.815, 2.055], ["leaving", 2.055, 2.344], ["the", 2.344, 2.416], ["country", 2.416, 2.861], ["for", 3.077, 3.233], ["more", 3.245, 3.618], ["than", 3.618, 3.738], ["two", 3.75, 3.954], ["years", 3.954, 4.495], ["while", 4.868, 5.084], ["experts", 5.18, 5.649], ["examine", 5.661, 6.13], ["it", 6.142, 6.322], ["Estimates", 6.707, 7.079], ["go", 7.079, 7.224], ["up", 7.224, 7.308], ["to", 7.32, 7.416], ["one", 7.416, 7.548], ["hundred", 7.56, 7.837], ["and", 7.837, 7.897], ["fifty", 7.909, 8.257], ["million", 8.257, 8.642], ["euros", 8.642, 9.243]]}, {"text": "An auction is set for June 2019. But just days before, it's suddenly called off.", "start": 253.092, "end": 258.66, "spec": {"shot": "c_cancel", "ui": "cancel"}, "afx": null, "words": [["An", 0.084, 0.168], ["auction", 0.168, 0.505], ["is", 0.517, 0.625], ["set", 0.625, 0.938], ["for", 0.938, 1.154], ["June 2019", 1.166, 2.825], ["But", 3.221, 3.281], ["just", 3.281, 3.45], ["days", 3.45, 3.642], ["before", 3.642, 4.062], ["it's", 4.074, 4.183], ["suddenly", 4.195, 4.543], ["called", 4.543, 4.808], ["off", 4.808, 5.24]]}, {"text": "A private collector bought it. The price is a secret. And some experts still doubt it's a real Caravaggio.", "start": 259.08, "end": 265.944, "spec": {"shot": "c_secret", "ui": "secret"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.096, 0.156], ["private", 0.168, 0.577], ["collector", 0.589, 0.925], ["bought", 0.938, 1.154], ["it", 1.166, 1.31], ["The", 1.695, 1.743], ["price", 1.743, 2.236], ["is", 2.368, 2.452], ["a", 2.452, 2.5], ["secret", 2.512, 3.041], ["And", 3.438, 3.498], ["some", 3.51, 3.678], ["experts", 3.69, 4.123], ["still", 4.123, 4.519], ["doubt", 4.676, 5.036], ["it's", 5.144, 5.24], ["a", 5.24, 5.288], ["real", 5.288, 5.769], ["Caravaggio", 5.769, 6.526]]}, {"text": "And number one. A small town north of Paris, 2019.", "start": 266.364, "end": 270.492, "spec": {"shot": "k_house", "cut": true, "mood": "calm", "ui": "n1"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.168], ["number", 0.168, 0.385], ["one", 0.397, 0.697], ["A", 1.082, 1.118], ["small", 1.118, 1.406], ["town", 1.406, 1.695], ["north", 1.707, 1.959], ["of", 1.959, 2.019], ["Paris", 2.019, 2.572], ["2019", 2.776, 3.762]]}, {"text": "A woman in her nineties is selling her house. An auctioneer comes by to value everything inside.", "start": 270.912, "end": 277.128, "spec": {"shot": "k_value", "ui": "nineties"}, "afx": null, "words": [["A", 0.084, 0.144], ["woman", 0.144, 0.385], ["in", 0.385, 0.433], ["her", 0.433, 0.529], ["nineties", 0.529, 1.214], ["is", 1.322, 1.454], ["selling", 1.466, 1.887], ["her", 1.899, 2.019], ["house", 2.031, 2.596], ["An", 2.957, 3.041], ["auctioneer", 3.053, 3.594], ["comes", 3.594, 3.882], ["by", 3.882, 4.038], ["to", 4.038, 4.123], ["value", 4.135, 4.688], ["everything", 4.832, 5.325], ["inside", 5.337, 5.877]]}, {"text": "In the kitchen, above the hot plate, hangs a tiny painting on wood. Smaller than a sheet of paper.", "start": 277.548, "end": 283.62, "spec": {"shot": "k_tiny", "ui": "tiny"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.072, 0.132], ["the", 0.132, 0.192], ["kitchen", 0.192, 0.661], ["above", 0.925, 1.274], ["the", 1.274, 1.322], ["hot", 1.334, 1.671], ["plate", 1.671, 2.031], ["hangs", 2.392, 2.608], ["a", 2.608, 2.656], ["tiny", 2.656, 3.161], ["painting", 3.173, 3.51], ["on", 3.51, 3.69], ["wood", 3.69, 3.954], ["Smaller", 4.351, 4.796], ["than", 4.796, 4.88], ["a", 4.88, 4.904], ["sheet", 4.916, 5.204], ["of", 5.204, 5.276], ["paper", 5.288, 5.733]]}, {"text": "The family thinks it's an old religious icon. Nothing special.", "start": 284.04, "end": 288.096, "spec": {"shot": "k_icon", "ui": "icon"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.108, 0.156], ["family", 0.168, 0.529], ["thinks", 0.529, 0.937], ["it's", 1.022, 1.13], ["an", 1.13, 1.274], ["old", 1.382, 1.623], ["religious", 1.635, 2.055], ["icon", 2.067, 2.56], ["Nothing", 2.945, 3.173], ["special", 3.173, 3.702]]}, {"text": "But the auctioneer recognizes it right away. It looks like early Italian art. Maybe worth three or four hundred thousand euros.", "start": 288.516, "end": 296.196, "spec": {"shot": "k_spot", "ui": "spot"}, "afx": null, "words": [["But", 0.096, 0.18], ["the", 0.192, 0.252], ["auctioneer", 0.252, 0.829], ["recognizes", 0.829, 1.514], ["it", 1.514, 1.671], ["right", 1.683, 1.851], ["away", 1.851, 2.284], ["It", 2.668, 2.728], ["looks", 2.74, 2.861], ["like", 2.861, 3.017], ["early", 3.137, 3.377], ["Italian", 3.377, 3.774], ["art", 3.774, 4.014], ["Maybe", 4.411, 4.627], ["worth", 4.627, 4.844], ["three", 4.856, 5.373], ["or", 5.481, 5.685], ["four", 5.817, 6.166], ["hundred", 6.178, 6.43], ["thousand", 6.43, 6.791], ["euros", 6.791, 7.344]]}, {"text": "And the expert who checks it? The same man from the Caravaggio story.", "start": 296.616, "end": 300.504, "spec": {"shot": "k_expert", "ui": "same"}, "afx": null, "words": [["And", 0.096, 0.156], ["the", 0.156, 0.228], ["expert", 0.24, 0.673], ["who", 0.673, 0.781], ["checks", 0.781, 1.13], ["it", 1.13, 1.298], ["The", 1.695, 1.743], ["same", 1.743, 2.007], ["man", 2.007, 2.272], ["from", 2.284, 2.404], ["the", 2.404, 2.452], ["Caravaggio", 2.452, 3.065], ["story", 3.065, 3.546]]}, {"text": "His team scans it with infrared light, and compares it to other works.", "start": 300.924, "end": 305.148, "spec": {"shot": "k_scan", "ui": "scan"}, "afx": null, "words": [["His", 0.096, 0.204], ["team", 0.204, 0.469], ["scans", 0.481, 0.877], ["it", 0.877, 0.974], ["with", 0.974, 1.118], ["infrared", 1.214, 1.719], ["light", 1.719, 2.031], ["and", 2.428, 2.512], ["compares", 2.512, 2.993], ["it", 3.005, 3.077], ["to", 3.089, 3.185], ["other", 3.185, 3.401], ["works", 3.401, 3.882]]}, {"text": "The verdict: it's by Cimabue, a master from around 1280. Only a handful of his paintings still exist.", "start": 305.568, "end": 312.84, "spec": {"shot": "k_cimabue", "ui": "y1280"}, "afx": null, "words": [["The", 0.096, 0.168], ["verdict", 0.18, 0.613], ["it's", 1.01, 1.106], ["by", 1.106, 1.262], ["Cimabue", 1.262, 2.091], ["a", 2.5, 2.572], ["master", 2.584, 3.125], ["from", 3.125, 3.245], ["around", 3.245, 3.57], ["1280", 3.57, 4.159], ["Only", 4.543, 4.748], ["a", 4.748, 4.796], ["handful", 4.808, 5.385], ["of", 5.385, 5.445], ["his", 5.445, 5.541], ["paintings", 5.541, 6.13], ["still", 6.142, 6.382], ["exist", 6.382, 6.923]]}, {"text": "In October 2019, about eight hundred people pack into the auction room. The bids keep climbing.", "start": 313.26, "end": 319.476, "spec": {"shot": "k_auction", "mood": "tense", "ui": "auction"}, "afx": null, "words": [["In", 0.072, 0.156], ["October 2019", 0.156, 1.659], ["about", 2.055, 2.332], ["eight", 2.5, 2.62], ["hundred", 2.632, 2.909], ["people", 2.909, 3.185], ["pack", 3.185, 3.582], ["into", 3.594, 3.714], ["the", 3.714, 3.798], ["auction", 3.81, 4.195], ["room", 4.207, 4.411], ["The", 4.796, 4.856], ["bids", 4.856, 5.132], ["keep", 5.144, 5.385], ["climbing", 5.397, 5.865]]}, {"text": "Twenty-four million euros. For a painting that hung over the stove.", "start": 319.896, "end": 324.144, "spec": {"shot": "k_sold", "ui": "eur24m"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Twenty-four", 0.096, 0.565], ["million", 0.565, 0.889], ["euros", 0.889, 1.454], ["For", 1.863, 1.947], ["a", 1.947, 1.995], ["painting", 1.995, 2.392], ["that", 2.404, 2.512], ["hung", 2.512, 2.921], ["over", 3.113, 3.281], ["the", 3.293, 3.365], ["stove", 3.365, 3.882]]}, {"text": "France blocked the buyer from taking it abroad. In 2023, the Louvre bought it.", "start": 324.564, "end": 329.772, "spec": {"shot": "k_louvre", "mood": "bright", "ui": "louvre"}, "afx": null, "words": [["France", 0.12, 0.481], ["blocked", 0.481, 0.95], ["the", 0.95, 1.058], ["buyer", 1.058, 1.43], ["from", 1.43, 1.599], ["taking", 1.611, 1.947], ["it", 1.947, 1.995], ["abroad", 1.995, 2.428], ["In 2023", 2.812, 3.786], ["the", 4.014, 4.123], ["Louvre", 4.123, 4.447], ["bought", 4.447, 4.699], ["it", 4.699, 4.868]]}, {"text": "So maybe go and check what's hanging in your grandma's kitchen.", "start": 330.192, "end": 333.24, "spec": {"shot": "k_grandma", "ui": "grandma"}, "afx": null, "words": [["So", 0.108, 0.252], ["maybe", 0.252, 0.481], ["go", 0.493, 0.829], ["and", 1.022, 1.106], ["check", 1.106, 1.334], ["what's", 1.334, 1.466], ["hanging", 1.478, 1.791], ["in", 1.791, 1.851], ["your", 1.851, 1.935], ["grandma's", 1.947, 2.332], ["kitchen", 2.344, 2.692]]}, {"text": "Which find would you most like to make? Tell me in the comments. And subscribe to Roundhead Stories for more true money stories.", "start": 333.66, "end": 340.692, "spec": {"shot": "outro", "ui": "end"}, "afx": null, "words": [["Which", 0.096, 0.216], ["find", 0.216, 0.409], ["would", 0.409, 0.517], ["you", 0.517, 0.577], ["most", 0.577, 0.817], ["like", 0.817, 0.962], ["to", 0.962, 1.046], ["make", 1.046, 1.43], ["Tell", 1.827, 1.959], ["me", 1.959, 2.067], ["in", 2.067, 2.127], ["the", 2.139, 2.199], ["comments", 2.2, 2.812], ["And", 3.221, 3.305], ["subscribe", 3.305, 3.846], ["to", 3.858, 3.978], ["Roundhead", 3.978, 4.471], ["Stories", 4.471, 4.88], ["for", 5.024, 5.168], ["more", 5.168, 5.481], ["true", 5.493, 5.829], ["money", 5.829, 6.046], ["stories", 6.058, 6.683]]}], "dur": 343.69}